stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> planned : run created
    planned --> discovering : discover
    discovering --> discovered : all queries done/degraded
    discovered --> enriching : enrich
    enriching --> enriched : site queue drained
    enriched --> dm_pending : DM candidates exist
    enriched --> scoring : --skip-dm or none found
    dm_pending --> scoring : dm apply received
    scoring --> scored
    scored --> exported : sheet written
    discovering --> failed : no provider usable
    exported --> [*]
    note right of dm_pending
        the ONLY stage that waits on the agent
    end note
    note right of discovering
        checkpoints per query
        resume skips completed work
    end note
